    ns1:description "Combining p-values from multiple statistical tests is common in bioinformatics. however, this procedure is non-trivial for dependent p-values. this package implements an empirical adaptation of brown’s method (an extension of fisher’s method) for combining dependent p-values which is appropriate for highly correlated data sets found in high-throughput biological experiments." ;
