    ns1:description "Analysis of ct values from high throughput quantitative real-time pcr (qpcr) assays across multiple conditions or replicates. the input data can be from spatially-defined formats such abi taqman low density arrays or openarray; lightcycler from roche applied science, etc. it handles data loading, quality assessment, normalization, visualization and parametric or non-parametric testing for statistical significance in ct values between features." ;
