    ns1:conformsTo "https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalTool/1.0-RELEASE" ;
    ns1:description "Implements a general and flexible zero-inflated negative binomial model that can be used to provide a low-dimensional representations of single-cell rna-seq data. the model accounts for zero inflation (dropouts), over-dispersion, and the count nature of the data. the model also accounts for the difference in library sizes and optionally for batch effects and/or other covariates, avoiding the need for pre-normalize the data." ;
    ns1:identifier <https://bio.tools/zinbwave> ;
