    ns1:description "Gene model mapper (gemoma) is a homology-based gene prediction program. gemoma uses the annotation of protein-coding genes in a reference genome to infer the annotation of protein-coding genes in a target genome. thereby, gemoma utilizes amino acid sequence and intron position conservation. in addition, gemoma allows to incorporate rna-seq evidence for splice site prediction." ;
