<https://biocontainers.pro/tools/peptide-shaker> a ns1:SoftwareApplication ;
    ns1:citation "doi:10.1038/nbt.3109" ;
    ns1:conformsTo "https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalTool/1.0-RELEASE" ;
    ns1:description "Peptideshaker is a search engine independent platform for interpretation of proteomics identification results from multiple search engines, currently supporting x!tandem, ms-gf+, ms amanda, omssa, myrimatch, comet, tide, mascot, andromeda and mzidentml. by combining the results from multiple search engines, while re-calculating ptm localization scores and redoing the protein inference, peptideshaker attempts to give you the best possible understanding of your proteomics data!" ;
