    ns1:description "Solve a system of nonlinear equations using a Broyden or a Newton method with a choice of global strategies such as line search and trust region. There are options for using a numerical or user supplied Jacobian, for specifying a banded numerical Jacobian and for allowing a singular or ill-conditioned Jacobian." ;
    ns1:license "GPL-3.0" ;
    ns1:name "r-nleqslv" ;
    ns1:provider <https://biocontainers.pro> ;
